  "vibe": "A calligraphy studio at working pace. The ground is rice paper #f2ede2 carrying #26221e ink and exactly one vermilion seal #c93b2a; Cormorant Garamond sets headlines in sentence case over Commissioner body — nothing is uppercase, nothing shouts. The backdrop is a brush drawing itself: a 26px stroke sweeps the lower third as a thinner stroke falls down the right, pale wash ellipses drift sideways, a broken ink circle turns slowly at the top-left, and a red hanko seal sits stamped in the corner. Its signature beat is Typing:hand — words land one at a time, each tilted a degree or two, every fourth in seal red, closing on an underlined stamp. The camera barely moves (rotation 0.5). Best for tea, stationery, ceramics, meditation and patient craft brands.",
